{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a person faces an unjustified death, their soul cannot find rest. These restless spirits transform into horrifying beings known as the Unresting. To banish an Unresting, the soul must be re-executed\u2014killed once more. When hordes of the Unresting gather, a re-executor is summoned. Re-executors are warriors specially trained to eliminate the Unresting, wielding weapons made from human bones, believed to be most effective against these restless horrors. The land of Liandra is on the brink of being overrun by the Unresting. A skilled re-executor named Ivona is sent to cleanse the land. However, shortly after her arrival, she disappears. As the Unresting swarm the land, a new re-executor called Noose arrives. Armed with a whip made from human spines, Noose sets out on a mission\u2014to finish the re-execution and find Ivona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=816 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.webm?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.mp4?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine Lasher is an action-platformer inspired by NES classics, serving as a true homage to gaming in the 8-bit era</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, retro-style action and platforming gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a Metroidvania, but a Megavania! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels filled with enemies, traps, challenging bosses, and branching paths that can only be accessed with specific items and abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/ed9cbaef62ef70eb8afaaf6dd4bde923.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=816 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/ed9cbaef62ef70eb8afaaf6dd4bde923.webm?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/ed9cbaef62ef70eb8afaaf6dd4bde923.mp4?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional mini-bosses and bonus levels for extra challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible cards that unlock powerful upgrades for your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your surroundings strategically\u2014drop objects onto enemies to crush them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/608778d1f670fac99561195684c623f7.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=768 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/608778d1f670fac99561195684c623f7.webm?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/608778d1f670fac99561195684c623f7.mp4?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple sub-weapons, including axes, knives, throwing stars, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and upgrade your whip to enhance both offensive and defensive capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your whip to deflect enemy projectiles and turn their attacks against them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/5bbd61a2443d3266c97affef9ca8d51d.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=816 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/5bbd61a2443d3266c97affef9ca8d51d.webm?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/5bbd61a2443d3266c97affef9ca8d51d.mp4?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849530?t=1773655549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849530?t=1773655549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/fd72935755b82c86914976664d7d50d133883829/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773655549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/fd72935755b82c86914976664d7d50d133883829/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773655549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3909640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a person faces an unjustified death, their soul cannot find rest. These restless spirits transform into horrifying beings known as the Unresting. To banish an Unresting, the soul must be re-executed\u2014killed once more. When hordes of the Unresting gather, a re-executor is summoned. Re-executors are warriors specially trained to eliminate the Unresting, wielding weapons made from human bones, believed to be most effective against these restless horrors. The land of Liandra is on the brink of being overrun by the Unresting. A skilled re-executor named Ivona is sent to cleanse the land. However, shortly after her arrival, she disappears. As the Unresting swarm the land, a new re-executor called Noose arrives. Armed with a whip made from human spines, Noose sets out on a mission\u2014to finish the re-execution and find Ivona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=816 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.webm?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/8bc995e14c83be57eaf640c6dc936b4d.mp4?t=1773655549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine Lasher is an action-platformer inspired by NES classics, serving as a true homage to gaming in the 8-bit era</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, retro-style action and platforming gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a Metroidvania, but a Megavania! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels filled with enemies, traps, challenging bosses, and branching paths that can only be accessed with specific items and abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849530/extras/ed9cbaef62ef70eb8afaaf6dd4bde923.poster.avif?t=1773655549\" width=816 heigh